### Calculation Optimization
// Implementation of:
// - @battle-core-mechanics.mdc#Combat-Logic#Battalion-Combat
// - @battle-targeting-system.mdc#Combat-Flow#Battalion-Combat

// Referenced by:
// - @battle-node-control.mdc#Capture-System#Control-Progress
// - @battle-movement-system.mdc#Attack-Range-Behavior#Combat-Updates

- Batch damage calculations per update cycle
  - Group by battalion type
  - Pre-calculate modifiers
  - Cache common results
- Cache battalion stats
  - Total health = base_health * quantity
  - Total attack = base_offense * quantity
  - Defense multiplier = (1 - defense/100)
- Pre-calculate common values
  - Defense multipliers
  - Range thresholds
  - Capture requirements
- Optimize range checks
  - Use squared distances
  - Cache distance calculations
  - Update only when needed
- Minimize floating-point operations
  - Use integer math when possible
  - Round at display time only
  - Maintain precision internally

